"""Draw 2D molecular structure formulae from SMILES with optional PDB-derived atom names.

The molecular graph and stereochemistry are always defined by SMILES.  When a
PDB file is supplied, it is used only as a source of atom names/serials and as a
connectivity hint for matching those names onto the SMILES-defined molecule.
"""

